# Profiles
# Profiles control preset quality levels. Each profile sets shadow resolution,
# AO method, cloud steps, reflection quality and more. Switch profiles to
# trade performance for quality — Low for potato PCs, Ultra for high-end.
# Mac Compatible (red) disables Mac-incompatible or heavy features
# (Directional Sky Ambient, Colored Shadows/VPS) and keeps
# GTAO + 4× Aniso for smooth Mac performance.

profile.low                            =§e低
profile.medium                         =§a中
profile.high                           =§b高
profile.ultra                          =§d超高
profile.mac_compatible                 =§c兼容Mac系统

